
# Get all users for an account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/10000001/users
Accept: application/json

### Get user settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/USR-0001

### Send email to all provider users who have notifications turned on
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/email/10000001/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateId": "ebb28424-b1ce-4374-b24b-a240f0cecdc1",
  "tokens": {"coursename": "Abattoir worker", "larscode": "274"},
  "explicitEmailAddresses":["dev@gmail.com"]
}

###
## additionally send to explicit email addresses 
